[47.3587, "o", "◆ explored · read cart.py, catalog.py\r\n\r\n"]
[47.8873, "o", "- Tax is computed by multiplying the pre-tax amount in cents by 1.0825 (8.25% rate) and then rounding to the nearest whole cent using Python's built-in `round()` function.\r\n"]
[48.4320, "o", "- The rounding follows \"banker's rounding\" (round half to even), so values exactly halfway between cents round to the nearest even cent amount.\r\n"]
