[57.1758, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r\n"]
[57.6982, "o", "┊ We"]
[57.8504, "o", " need to read shop"]
[57.8836, "o", "/catalog.py and"]
[57.9197, "o", " run the cart tests"]
[57.9597, "o", " ("]
[57.9928, "o", "already done). Then"]
[58.0425, "o", " explain the catalog in"]
[58.0750, "o", " two bullets.\r\n┊ We"]
[58.1095, "o", " have"]
[58.1518, "o", " already read catalog.py"]
[58.1846, "o", " earlier. Let's"]
[58.2177, "o", " verify content"]
[58.2718, "o", " again"]
[58.3029, "o", " and maybe"]
[58.3335, "o", " run tests"]
[58.3656, "o", " to ensure"]
[58.4061, "o", " they pass"]
[58.4472, "o", ".\r\n┊ We"]
[58.4844, "o", "'ll run the"]
[58.5314, "o", " cart tests again to"]
[58.5633, "o", " be"]
[58.5860, "o", " safe"]
[58.6304, "o", ".\r\n┊ Then"]
[58.6952, "o", " produce"]
[58.7073, "o", " two bullet explanations"]
[58.7273, "o", "."]
[59.0539, "o", "\r\n"]
[59.0630, "o", "▸ $ python3 -m unittest tests.test_cart\r\n"]
[59.5572, "o", "  └ exit 0 · 7 lines\r\n    \r\n    stderr:\r\n    .\r\n    ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n    Ran 1 test in 0.000s\r\n    \r\n"]
[60.0322, "o", "┊ We"]
[60.0805, "o", " need to read shop"]
[60.1028, "o", "/catalog.py and"]
[60.1333, "o", " run the cart tests"]
[60.1839, "o", " ("]
[60.2115, "o", "already done). Then"]
[60.2498, "o", " explain the catalog in"]
[60.2974, "o", " two bullets.\r\n┊ We"]
[60.7508, "o", " have already"]
[62.3539, "o", " read catalog.py earlier"]
[63.4433, "o", ". Let's read"]
[63.5708, "o", " it again to be"]
[63.6000, "o", " sure.\r\n┊ Then"]
[63.6462, "o", " produce"]
[63.6822, "o", " two bullet points explaining"]
[63.7148, "o", " the catalog."]
[64.2498, "o", "\r\n▸ read shop/catalog.py\r\n  └      1\t\"\"\"Prices are in cents so money never touches floating point.\"\"\"\r\n         2\t\r\n         3\tfrom __future__ import annotations\r\n         4\t\r\n         5\tPRICES = {\r\n         6\t    \"tea\": 450,\r\n         7\t    \"mug\": 1200,\r\n"]
[65.1947, "o", "┊ We"]
[65.3478, "o", " need to explain"]
[65.3755, "o", " the catalog in two"]
[65.4365, "o", " bullets."]
[65.4618, "o", " The catalog"]
[65.4841, "o", " defines"]
[65.5372, "o", " prices in cents ("]
[65.5639, "o", "inte"]
[65.5945, "o", "gers) to avoid"]
[65.6316, "o", " floating point issues"]
[65.6611, "o", ". It provides a"]
[65.6946, "o", " price"]
[65.7430, "o", " function that looks"]
[65.7666, "o", " up SK"]
[65.8152, "o", "U and raises"]
[65.8542, "o", " ValueError for unknown"]
[65.8778, "o", " SKU."]
[65.9231, "o", "\r\n┊ \r\n┊ Let's produce two"]
[65.9578, "o", " bullets."]
[65.9906, "o", "\r\n\r\n"]
[66.4595, "o", "- The catalog stores item prices as integers representing cents (e.g., tea is 450¢) to keep all monetary calculations exact and avoid floating-point inaccuracies.  \r\n"]
[67.3461, "o", "- The `price(sku)` function returns the price for a valid SKU or raises a `ValueError` with a clear message for unknown SKUs, ensuring the cart only processes recognized items.\r\n"]
[67.3461, "o", "\r\n✓ 1 read · 1 command · 10s · ↑11.1k ↓308 · ctx 2%\r\n\r\n"]
[67.3697, "o", "\u001b[?2004h\r\u001b[K› \r\u001b[2C"]
[70.0962, "o", "\r\u001b[K› /help\r\n › /help                      every command, and your skills\r\n   /goal <objective>          keep going until it's done and verified\r\n   /loop <[5m] [x10] prompt>  repeat on an interval, or let rusty pick the pace\r\n   /compact [focus]           summarise now; say what matters most to keep it in detail\r\n   /side new <name> | open <id or name> | list open a persistent read-only side discussion\r\n   /send main                 send selected side findings to the main chat\r\n   /back                      return to the main chat\r\n   /btw [question]            ask from existing context without changing the main chat\r\n   36 more · ↑↓ choose · tab completes · enter runs\u001b[9A\r\u001b[3C"]
